WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,470
Aren't you afraid, girl?

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:07,590
What are you afraid of?

3
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:09,790
these corpses

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,740
I'm not afraid of them

5
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:16,170
I'm more afraid of you getting hurt, Master.

6
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,740
Let me check if you are injured

7
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,560
Listen, I'm not hurt

8
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:25,170
I don't believe it

9
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:26,890
Look, you are covered in blood

10
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:33,950
Just hope your young master is fine

11
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:52,750
Relatives died under the sword of the Northern Barbarians

12
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:55,380
These beasts

13
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:57,060
Never hold grudges at any time
